    <briefdescription>
<para>Sends one request to the daemon of a manifest, and prints the reply. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The client connects to the daemon through the port file. When no daemon answers, it starts one as a detached process. It watches the cache folder, so that it connects when the port file appears. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
